+# Image generation prompts
+
+Generated with the built-in image generation tool, without reference images. Final images converted and resized with sips to 1024 × 1024 PNG.
+
+## styles/693-peter-arno.png
+
+Generate ONE fresh original square image, 1024x1024, entirely from this text. No reference images. Use case: stylized-concept. Style priority: an authentic Peter Arno 1930s society cartoon, confident thick brush-ink contours, economical expressive caricature, fluid gray ink washes on white paper, one dramatically dominant solid-black shape. NOT a photograph, not a filter, not realistic anatomy. Scene: an elegant society nightclub interpreted with a few deft marks; the dominant black shape is the sweeping back of a banquette, balanced against abundant untouched paper. A large exuberantly drawn woman in her early 30s sits in an expansive relaxed three-quarter full-body pose, delighting in a tiny coffee cup raised in one hand. Her oversized head and expressive sweeping limbs follow period cartoon proportions. Curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses, mustard-yellow knit sweater; interpret the auburn and mustard with extremely restrained hand-tinted washes within the otherwise black-and-gray drawing. A croissant rests on a small cocktail table beside her. Subject occupies much of the frame, angular tilted pose, spare nightclub details behind her. Hand-drawn wit and assertive black brushwork dictate every shape. No text, caption, signature, lettering, logos or watermarks.
+
+## styles/694-lyonel-feininger.png
+
+Generate ONE fresh original square image, 1024x1024, from text only, without any reference images. Use case: stylized-concept. An authentic Lyonel Feininger painting: a crystalline city made of overlapping luminous prismatic planes, soaring faceted buildings, fractured shafts of light, severe diagonals and translucent angular color. The entire image is painted geometry, including the human anatomy; never a photo or a photographic image with a filter. Wide dramatic street composition with a large elongated faceted woman standing in profile in the foreground, extending from near the bottom to near the top, and city architecture receding deeply on oblique axes around her. She is in her early 30s, has shoulder-length curly auburn hair expressed as broken russet angular rhythms, freckles as spare tiny geometric flecks, round tortoiseshell glasses translated into segmented circular outlines, and a mustard-yellow knit sweater transformed into ochre golden planes. She enjoys a small coffee cup held near her lips. A faceted croissant on a small angular cafe table is close beside her. Strong crystalline light breaks the sweater, cup, figure and city into interlocking wedges; cool ultramarine, smoky lilac and luminous pale gold; painterly surface, fine uneven edges from a real brush. Let the style determine elongated proportions, distorted perspective and monumental urban staging. No text, captions, signature, logos or watermarks.
+
+## styles/695-pierre-bonnard.png
+
+Generate ONE entirely new text-only square image, 1024x1024. No reference images. Use case: stylized-concept. An authentic Pierre Bonnard painting of an intimate patterned domestic room, immersive dappled color, vibrating small brush touches and softened boundaries. A close, large woman in her early 30s is absorbed in enjoying coffee at a breakfast table. Shoulder-length curly auburn hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater, all dissolved naturally into the oil-painted color relationships. Composition is intimate and off-center: look obliquely down over a richly patterned tablecloth, fruit, a coffee cup in her hand and a croissant nearby; her large bent head, shoulder and torso are close to the viewer and partially cropped at the right edge. Overlapping table and room planes tilt gently, with no rigid optical perspective. Patterned wallpaper, sunlit fabric and warm interior reflections make a dense color tapestry around her; the room feels lived in, private and quiet. Radiant yellow and orange dappled with violet shadows, rose, verdigris, small unexpected complementary hues. Soft anatomically simplified hands, absorbed expression, visible intimate oil brushwork, no outlined cartoon shapes. Let painting and color entirely govern form and light: absolutely no photo or photo-filter appearance, no photographic depth of field, no polished digital skin. No lettering, text, caption, signature, logo or watermark.
+
+## styles/696-alex-katz.png
+
+Create one NEW original 1024x1024 square image solely from this text, NO image references. This is an Alex Katz painting: monumentally cropped huge calm face, hard edges, extremely reductive flat shape painting. Critical formal rule: each color region is completely UNIFORM from edge to edge, as if cut from a single solid-colored sheet of opaque paper. There must be ZERO gradients, ZERO shading, ZERO modeled volume, ZERO shadows or highlights, ZERO glossy effects, ZERO vignette. A face is one uninterrupted solid pale peach shape, the mustard-yellow sweater is one uninterrupted solid mustard silhouette, the hair is one solid auburn silhouette with curly outer contours and only a few green negative-space gaps. No lighter/darker interior streaks. No canvas texture or lighting effects. Matte paint, sophisticated sparse painted shapes, boldly simplified anatomy. Character: a woman in her early 30s, shoulder-length curly auburn hair, a few freckles represented by flat ochre dots, round tortoiseshell glasses represented by flat dark brown rings with a few flat amber patches. Her immense tranquil face occupies most of the square, frontal with subtly turned eyes, cropped curly hair at the edges. Two spare lines indicate her nose, two minimalist eyes and a single muted brick-red flat lip shape. A simple flat hand holds an unshaded white coffee cup low at the left edge as she enjoys her coffee. Its contents are a single solid brown ellipse. The croissant nearby at bottom-right is a flat ochre crescent with three dark-brown curved separation marks, no tonal modeling. A thin solid pale gray-green strip indicates the table. One completely uniform cool green background surrounds the head. The composition reads immediately as hard-edge fine-art portrait painting in the style of Alex Katz, not a photograph and not digital airbrush illustration. Keep the sweater absolutely one single solid mustard color. No text, letters, captions, signature, watermark, logos.
+

